        "Background": "Once a skilled assassin for the Clan Cave Fox, Raine broke from the clan after discovering that a contract kill was, in fact, his own estranged father. Disgusted with himself, he abandoned that life -- but the clan doesn't let members leave, and dispatched his old comrade Shou to hunt him down. Raine now wanders, trying to atone by helping those he can.",
        "Personality": "Reserved and thoughtful, Raine speaks only when he has something worth saying, and his mind often wanders even when he's paying close attention -- a habit that leads people to underestimate him. He practices swordsmanship and origami in his spare time, often folding paper to help himself think."
