        "Background": "Raine: Lines in Full\n-2 Code of Conduct (Will Not Fight Surprised or Defenseless Opponents)\n\nRaine: Attacks\nKaze Satsujinsha: Raine's skill with a sword is extraordinary. His legendary katana is a suitable companion.\nRaging Thunder Slash: Raine whispers across his blade before striking with crackling electrical energy.\nElectrical Storm (Affinity: Electricity; Perks: Area Effect x2, Effective; Flaws: Requirement: Must Be Outside (-10), Weapon): Raine summons the power of nature to cut swaths through legions of enemies.\nMist Touch: Raine concentrates his energies to project his very spirit into the opponent's mind.\n\nRaine: Nightmares\nRaine is plagued by nightmares of his violent past, especially his father's death, and rarely sleeps soundly -- his sudden awakenings can startle anyone nearby."
      }
